@DOC ver=2.0 | kind=note | id=greenpulse-brainstorm | title="GreenPulse — Mobile App Concept Brainstorm" | profile=decl | fmt=canon

@NOTE text="Pure ideation session. Nothing decided. Think big, think weird, don't self-censor."

@SEC name="Idea 1: Personal Carbon Dashboard"

@NOTE text="Mint-for-carbon-footprint. Users connect bank accounts, auto-categorize spending into carbon impact. Uses Plaid for bank integration, carbon APIs (Climatiq, CarbonInterface) for estimates — but none are great for individual transactions. Would need custom mapping layer."

@MAP id=carbon_features | pairs=["carbon_budget"->"calorie counter for CO2","trends"->"weekly/monthly charts with animations","social_compare"->"anonymous friend averages","gamification"->"badges, streaks, challenges (Meatless Monday)","ar_vision"->"point at product, see carbon score (probably too hard)"]

@NOTE text="Concerns: privacy barrier (bank data sharing), calculation accuracy (rough estimates), UX for confidence intervals (confusing for casual users)."

@SEC name="Idea 2: Neighborhood Sustainability Map"

@NOTE text="Google Maps meets Nextdoor. User-generated pins: sustainable businesses, gardens, EV chargers, recycling, compost sites. OpenStreetMap-style community content. Low cost but needs moderation."

@MAP id=map_revenue | pairs=["verified_pins"->"businesses pay for eco-checkmark","gov_sponsors"->"local government boards","grants"->"nonprofit route (credible but less fundable)","geo_challenges"->"visit 5 green businesses → discount bundle (brands pay)"]

@SEC name="Idea 3: Food Waste Countdown Timer"

@NOTE text="Scan grocery receipt or manual entry. App predicts spoilage. Push notifications with timing: 'avocados peak tomorrow — 3 recipes' or 'bananas entering freeze zone.' Integration with recipe APIs (Spoonacular, Edamam) and food-sharing apps (Too Good To Go, OLIO)."

@NOTE text="Notification timing is everything — too early = ignored, too late = wasted."
@NOTE text="Possible V2 combination with Idea 1: single sustainability score (carbon + food waste). But scope creep for MVP — park it."

@SEC name="Idea 4: Anti-Fast-Fashion Closet"

@NOTE text="Digital wardrobe: photo catalog, AI categorization, outfit suggestions from existing clothes. Anti-shopping personal stylist. When buying, app discourages first ('You have 6 white t-shirts'). Then suggests sustainable alternatives (thrift, ethical brands)."

@MAP id=closet_tech | pairs=["ai_styling"->"object detection + fashion sense (GPT-4V or Pinterest data)","business_model"->"affiliate links to sustainable brands or subscription tier","crazy_extension"->"social closet-sharing (Airbnb for wardrobes — probably its own startup)"]

@SEC name="Next Steps"

@MAP id=actions | pairs=["everyone"->"vote top 2 ideas by Friday","schedule"->"deep-dive session next week on winners","Alex"->"research carbon API landscape","Sarah"->"sketch wireframes for top-voted concept","Mark"->"competitive analysis (Joro, Commons, CoGo, Oroeco)"]
@NOTE text="No budget decisions yet — still exploratory."
